00:12:11.590 --> 00:12:14.350
Like we talked about this yesterday,

00:12:14.350 --> 00:12:18.190
almost seven and a half data bytes of data each year.

00:12:18.190 --> 00:12:23.740
Each analysis has as much as 100 gigabytes plus.

00:12:23.740 --> 00:12:25.059
And like we discussed,

00:12:25.059 --> 00:12:28.379
there are so many pressures pulling on pathologists

00:12:28.379 --> 00:12:31.139
on every case, so many responsibilities.

00:12:32.019 --> 00:12:34.899
The data is coming from disparate technologies.

00:12:34.899 --> 00:12:36.659
The literature is evolving.

